        "original_id": "be269e30-18c7-5e9e-8667-bda85c0950c5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Labrador Retriever, Tibetan Terrier, Spike, Mastador\n- Concepts: retriever-gun dog, Dokhi Apso, outdoor Apso, dog actor, Old Yeller\n- Events: 1957 Disney film Old Yeller\n\nFacts:\n- The Labrador Retriever, also called Labrador, is a type of retriever-gun dog.\n- Some old travelers' accounts refer to the Tibetan Terrier as Dokhi Apso or \"outdoor\" Apso, indicating a shaggy or bearded working dog that lives outdoors.\n- Spike was a lop-eared yellow Mastador, a Mastiff and Labrador Retriever mix.\n- Spike was a dog actor best known for playing Old Yeller in the 1957 Disney film Old Yeller.\n- The 1957 Disney film Old Yeller co-starred Tommy Kirk, Dorothy McGuire, Fess Parker, and Kevin Corcoran.",
